# the elder (STYLE_P2 14): the man's clips, the head stack a pixel lower (a pixel forward in side views); the shoulders round
# (the garments' `when elder` views); the elder never runs (FOLK-SIM walks him at 0.8)
body man.elder
anchors D head=-8,-32 neck=0,-19 hip=0,-10 shoulderR=-7,-18 shoulderL=6,-18
anchors U head=-8,-32 neck=0,-19 hip=0,-10 shoulderR=6,-18 shoulderL=-7,-18
anchors R head=-7,-32 neck=0,-19 hip=0,-10 shoulderR=-1,-18 shoulderL=-1,-18
anchors L head=-9,-32 neck=0,-19 hip=0,-10 shoulderR=-1,-18 shoulderL=-1,-18

# the woman elder (STYLE_P2 14): her clips, the head stack a pixel lower (a pixel forward in side views); the shoulders round
# (her garments' `when elder` views); she never runs
